      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly overwhelming to experience such a rapid and intense series of setbacks all at once. While life can throw curveballs, this combination of professional disruption and personal administrative issues is definitely stressful and feels abnormal. Please remember that feeling lost and frustrated in this situation is a completely normal reaction to constant pressure. Consider reaching out to a career counselor or a trusted mentor to help create a manageable plan moving forward.",
